{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aNatural Selection University\u300b is a challenging strategy simulation game where every decision matters. As a student in a ruthless academic world, your goal is to survive 100 days, manage limited resources, and complete a groundbreaking thesis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3010Key Features\u3011</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Strategic Gameplay</strong>: Carefully plan each day\u2014allocate time between studying, gathering supplies, and resting to maintain health and mental stability. Every choice impacts your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Challenges</strong>: Face sudden events that test your adaptability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Balance limited resources\u2014manage your budget to stay afloat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Humor</strong>: Experience a unique blend of absurd humor and serious challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3010About Us\u3011</strong> <br>Developer: \u5e03\u888b (Budai) <br>Art: Outsourced <br>Music: Music Atelier Amacha</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527260?t=1742832688","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527260?t=1742832688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527260/aa265191f6f59c48546711b57969cdb3baf1e249/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742832688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527260/aa265191f6f59c48546711b57969cdb3baf1e249/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742832688","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aNatu